OL,3,GNEWSADogs not 'social media ready'
OL,4,Astruggling at shelters
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog adoption rates have fallen so low
OL,7,Fshelters are facing the prospect of
OL,8,Fhaving to euthanise animals, volunteers
OL,9,Fhave warned.
OL,11,FVolunteers for Dogs Friends, a
OL,12,FSomerset-based rescue, said they had
OL,13,Fnever seen so few applications for
OL,14,Ffostering and adoptions, as well as
OL,15,F"fussier" attitudes from prospective
OL,16,Fowners.
OL,18,FWith so many more pets being given away
OL,19,Fafter the pandemic and vets bills
OL,20,Fhigher than ever, the pressure on
OL,21,Fshelters has stretched many of them far
OL,22,Fbeyond their means.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
