OL,3,GNEWSADogs not 'social media ready'
OL,4,Astruggling at shelters
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Streeter, who volunteers at Dogs
OL,7,FFriends, said she had seen fewer people
OL,8,Fwilling to look after dogs that were
OL,9,Fnot "social media ready".
